4.5 Secure Environment Configuration & API Keys 
API credentials are never hard-coded into the application source. Instead, the Gemini module loads 
a .env file at runtime using python -dotenv and reads the GEMINI_API_KEY environment 
variable, following standard secure-configuration practice and allowing t he same codebase to be 
deployed across different environments without modification.ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ